  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">All On - Ceesolar Solar Mini-grid Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a solar mini-grid system (20kW/43kWh) to be constructed at Abaribara in Egup-Ipa District in Akamkpa LGA, Cross River state. The community is an off-grid community with no access to clean and affordable energy for daily use. The major impact of this project is increased access to sustainable energy to a population in the Nigerian Delta region.</narrative>
  </description>
